# Local cache data
data/isin_ticker_cache.json
# Ignore everything under data/ EXCEPT tracked ground-truth files. Must use
# `data/*` (not `data/`) so git walks the directory — a negation cannot
# re-include a file whose parent directory is itself excluded.
data/*
# Exception: hand-labeled ground truth (not cache) — tests depend on it and it
# has no regenerator, so it must be tracked or it silently vanishes on deletion.
!data/news_quality_exemplars.json

